{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1321218001:1":{"text":"おい！ここに足跡があるぞ！","source_cn":"快看！这里有脚印！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBADA34D317A9A2D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321218002:1":{"text":"僕に見せてみて！","source_cn":"啊！我来看看——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D3BE49552FDCA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321218003:1":{"text":"この靴底は……画伯のものだ！","source_cn":"这个鞋印，是偶像的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95070A759111895A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321218004:1":{"text":"なんと、芸術家は靴底のデザインまで自分でするんですね。","source_cn":"原来艺术家连鞋印的纹路都会自己设计。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7852066C9764ABF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321218005:1":{"text":"うーん……確かにこんな靴の跡は初めて見ます。","source_cn":"嚯……确实不是常见的款式呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x082F7E51229A45AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321218006:1":{"text":"つまり、ここを離れて間もないってことですね。","source_cn":"运气